<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential ups Xerox EPS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential ups Xerox EPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Alex Henderson said he raised his 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates on Xerox Corp to $3.80 a share from $3.75 a share and to $4.30 a share from $4.25 a share, respectively, after its strong first quarter.</p>
<p>-- Henderson maintains a strong buy rating on Xerox.</p>
<p>-- Xerox shares were up one to 58-3/8.</p>
